---
import ReferenceGallery from './ReferenceGallery.astro';
---
<section class="container coating-examples" id="coated-parts">
 <ReferenceGallery ids={['finish-coated-round','finish-coated-bars']} title="Surface-coated parts" description="These source photographs are labeled as Teflon surface coating. They show coated part forms, including circular components and long pieces with repeated holes. This is a surface treatment example; it is separate from parts made from PTFE material."/>
 <div class="coating-notes"><div><h3>Define the coating requirement</h3><p>Specify the substrate material, treatment specification and surfaces to coat or mask. State whether critical dimensions apply before or after coating. Agree any thickness, appearance or test requirements with the quotation.</p></div><div><h3>Compare the part construction</h3><p>Choose examples by the construction you need: a plastic part, a coated metal part or a component with a separate covering.</p><a class="text-link" href="/cases/custom-plastic-parts-ptfe-pom-pe-acrylic/">View plastic part examples →</a><a class="text-link" href="/products/#additional-part-forms">View covered wheels and rollers →</a></div></div>
 <p class="coating-boundary">The photographs show appearance and shape. They do not identify a coating grade, thickness, test result or performance rating.</p>
</section>
<style>
 .coating-examples{border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-bottom:56px;scroll-margin-top:110px}.coating-notes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:40px}.coating-notes h3{font-size:24px;line-height:1.3}.coating-notes p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;margin-top:16px}.coating-notes a{display:flex;width:fit-content;margin-top:20px}.coating-boundary{font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted);max-width:75ch;margin-top:32px}@media(max-width:760px){.coating-notes{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}}
</style>
